      "image": "assets/images/280021/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray a skillet with cooking spray and heat over medium-high heat. Quickly brown pork chops in the skillet, seasoning with garlic salt, 5 to 7 minutes total.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OFnqorHAO9Xx126lxIeZFjko7lA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/280021-slow-cooker-french-onion-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-2-65a7e0f6d587486c9e70a4b843b19eb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280021/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a slow cooker and pour French onion soup on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tlxQlATP5rAnLfdiC5nxnUoEuNo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/280021-slow-cooker-french-onion-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-3-bdad94b4e2e54259ab607d8d5a89c633.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280021/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low for 8 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uuBsF3k69y14RV_nZ1QwdP_F5Ug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/280021-slow-cooker-french-onion-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-4-92603c8ad3a2465a891a433ca172c893.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280021/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the chops and keep warm. Add sour cream and flour to the slow cooker, mix well, and warm until slightly thickened, 10 to 15 minutes.",
